 287:common/prog/firmware_update/mal/mal_command.c **** /** \brief checks if the address range is valid.
 288:common/prog/firmware_update/mal/mal_command.c ****  *  \details For security reasons it is important to check the 
 289:common/prog/firmware_update/mal/mal_command.c ****  *           The CRC is compared with the ongoing calculated CRC of
 290:common/prog/firmware_update/mal/mal_command.c ****  *           incoming data.
